#. multiline string, xgettext cannot parse it (see merge.sh)
msgid ""
"Some window decorations themes, e.g. Breeze or Plastik, could be installed "
"in your system as binary libraries and thus be visible and usable in System "
"settings, but they are not detectable and cannot be used by this widget. "
"There are no plans to support such binary themes due to technical "
"complications.\n"
"-\n"
"Regular Aurorae themes for window decorations are supported by this widget "
"and you can install them in System settings through \"Window decorations\" "
"page or use \"Breeze\" or \"Plasma\" options in \"Button icons source\" "
"field above instead"
msgstr ""
"某些窗口装饰主题（例如 Breeze 或 Plastik）在系统中可能以二进制库形式安装，因"
"此在系统设置中可见、可用，但本部件无法检测，也不能使用此类主题。由于技术原"
"因，暂无支持这些二进制主题的计划。\n"
"-\n"
"本部件支持常规的 Aurorae 窗口装饰主题，你可以在系统设置的“窗口装饰”页面安装它"
"们，或改用上方“按钮图标来源”中的“Breeze”或“Plasma”选项。"

#. multiline string, xgettext cannot parse it (see merge.sh)
msgid ""
"Some window decorations themes, e.g. Breeze or Plastik, could be installed "
"in your system as binary libraries and thus be visible and usable in System "
"settings, but they are not detectable and cannot be used by this widget. "
"There are no plans to support such binary themes due to technical "
"complications.\n"
"-\n"
"You can install more of regular Aurorae themes for window decorations in "
"System settings through \"Window decorations\" page or use \"Breeze\" or "
"\"Plasma\" options in \"Button icons source\" field above instead"
msgstr ""
"某些窗口装饰主题（例如 Breeze 或 Plastik）在系统中可能以二进制库形式安装，因"
"此在系统设置中可见、可用，但本部件无法检测，也不能使用此类主题。由于技术原"
"因，暂无支持这些二进制主题的计划。\n"
"-\n"
"你可以在系统设置的“窗口装饰”页面安装更多常规的 Aurorae 窗口装饰主题，或改用上"
"方“按钮图标来源”中的“Breeze”或“Plasma”选项。"
